 "A private boat across the bay to the small uninhabited island’s turquoise coves.": "Privāta laiva pāri līcim uz mazās neapdzīvotās salas tirkīzzilajiem līcīšiem.",
 "A quiet hill village about 450 m up on the edge of the Viros gorge, with a small Byzantine chapel of Agios Nikolaos.": "Kluss kalnu ciemats apmēram 450 m augstumā Viros aizas malā ar nelielu bizantiešu Agios Nikolaos kapelu.",
 "A relaxed village on a bay, with small, sandy Kalogria beach right next door.": "Mierīgs ciemats pie līča, bet tieši blakus – neliela smilšaina Kalogria pludmale.",
