 "Year-round; call about lunch": "Visu gadu; pusdienu laiku noskaidrojiet pa telefonu",
 "Yellow split peas, onion, olive oil. Topped with raw onion and capers.": "Dzeltenie šķeltie zirņi, sīpols, olīveļļa. Pārkaisa ar svaigu sīpolu un kaperiem.",
 "Yogurt with honey": "Jogurts ar medu",
 "You": "Jūs",
 "You can see the throne room and a clay bathtub that legend links to Telemachus’ bath in the Odyssey.": "Varat apskatīt troņa zāli un māla vannu, ko leģenda saista ar Telemaha peldi „Odisejā“.",
